/* Margin 2026.11.22 release titles and descriptions. */
"Faster at the bottom of the list" = "列表底部載入更快";
"Margin opens from the Dock as usual while Codex, Claude or another AI app uses it, with no extra icon bouncing in the Dock." = "在 Codex、Claude 或其他 AI App 使用時，Margin 也能照常從 Dock 打開，Dock 裡不會多出一個跳動的圖示。";
"Older mail loads before you reach the end, straight from what's saved on your Mac." = "在你滑到底部之前，較早的郵件就已直接從 Mac 上儲存的內容中載入。";
"Opens while AI apps are connected" = "AI App 連線時也能打開";
"Settings → AI Apps → Answer while Margin is closed: turn it off and AI apps ask you to open Margin instead." = "設定 → AI App → Margin 關閉時也回應：關閉後，AI App 會改為請你打開 Margin。";
"Your choice when Margin is closed" = "Margin 關閉時由你決定";
